# Build outputs and local state must never enter a build context: they make the
# context large, they defeat layer caching, and a stale build/ directory copied
# into an image is a class of "it worked on my machine" that is very hard to see.
.git
.github
.idea
**/build/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.gradle/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
web/.next/
docs/
prompts/
*.md
!README.md
